<title>USA: Mendocino Brewing sets secondary offering.</title>
<headline>Mendocino Brewing sets secondary offering.</headline>
<dateline>HOPLAND, Calif. 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mendocino Brewing Co Inc Monday said it filed to offer 600,000 shares of common stock at $8.50 per share.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said the purpose of the second stock offering is to bring a new brewing facility up to capacity as soon as possible and to upgrade the company's marketing capabilities to support increased national distribution.</p>
</text>
